<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 53.25 to 6609.16.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.63 to 402.31.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.17.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1338 to 1108.</p>
<p>Volume was 448,855,680 compared with 453,420,240 on Monday.</p>
